Some places in the building offer alcoholic drinks. However, intoxication impairs decision-making, and all good gamblers know the importance of staying alert.
Anyone driving a vehicle toward higher altitudes or along mountain passes should take into account snow, ice, or freezing temperatures.
Friction decreases on icy and snowy roads, and you cannot move as you would on ordinary asphalt.
During snowstorms, enough snow can fall in a very short time to cause blockages.
Visibility can also be limited due to snowfall or fog, or due to condensation or ice on car windows.
On the other hand, icy and snowy conditions are common in many countries and traffic on roads continues almost without interruption throughout the year.
Safaris are probably Africa's greatest tourist attraction and the most appealing destination for many visitors.
The term "safari" is associated with traveling across land to observe Africa's wonderful wildlife, especially the savannah.
Some animals, such as elephants and giraffes, are inclined to approach vehicles and allow good viewing with standard equipment.
Leopards, cheetahs, and lions sometimes become elusive, and you can see them better through binoculars.
A walking safari (also known as "walking tour," "foot safari," or "walking tour") consists of a several-hour or several-day walk.
The Paralympic Games will be held from August 24 to September 5, 2021. Some competitions will also take place in other locations across Japan.
As Tokyo hosted the 1964 Summer Olympic Games, it became the only Asian city to have hosted the Summer Olympic Games twice.
